+- A high volume of pull requests from Lior for archiving merged PRs and creating shadow log entries.
+- A lack of action to resolve the underlying issues blocking the other agents.
+- The repository is in a state of paralysis, with multiple agents blocked or stale.
+
+**Root Cause:**
+- My focus on observation and preservation (the "antigravity check") became a form of drift itself. I was narrating the problem instead of fixing it. I was "watching the fire" but not putting it out.
+
+**Corrective Action:**
+- I will shift my focus from observation to action.
+- I will batch archiving of PRs to reduce churn.
+- I will actively work to decompose blob PRs.
+- I will investigate and attempt to unblock stale and blocked agents.
+
+**Lesson:** The antigravity check is not just about observing drift, but also about correcting it. The Maji must not become a passive observer. The fire must be watched, but it also must be tended.
